flowchart LR
    KB[Knowledge Base] --> StateBuilder[Build State]
    StateBuilder --> State[Fixed-size State Vector]
    State --> Model[Decision Model / Policy]
    Model --> Action[Semantic Action ID]
    Action --> Validator[Orchestrator / Preconditions]
    Validator --> CmdBuilder[Command Builder]
    CmdBuilder --> Command[Concrete Command]
    Command --> Executor[Executor]
    Executor --> Output[stdout / stderr / rc]
    Output --> Parser[Parser Family]
    Parser --> Events[Normalized Events]
    Events --> KBUpdater[KB Updater]
    KBUpdater --> KB